# IOTA API and Train at Home control services
# Verified against observed requests and the installed vendor app on 2026-10-12.
# Surge RULE-SET format: the DIRECT policy belongs on the profile's RULE-SET line.
# Exact hosts only; storage and P2P relay services are deliberately not included.

# Worker orchestration API (observed in Surge requests)
DOMAIN,iota.api.macrocosmos.ai

# Dashboard API and Subnet 9 API (present in the installed vendor app)
DOMAIN,iota-web.api.macrocosmos.ai
DOMAIN,sn9.api.macrocosmos.ai

# Train at Home control, downloads and registration service
DOMAIN,tah.iota.macrocosmos.ai

